          <attvalue for="35" value="Large, visible increases in US/Canadian military and financial support for Ukraine generate domestic scrutiny and constituency demands to prioritize or protect local industries, raising pressure on leaders to take tariff or trade-positioning actions in the bilateral dispute." />
