          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Disruptions and sanctions on Russian crude prompt buyers to source more oil from Gulf producers, increasing tanker throughput through chokepoints such as the Strait of Hormuz and raising measured oil transit volume." />
