          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="War-driven interruptions to critical inputs and energy prompt North American manufacturers to regionalize and re-source components away from fragile cross-border chains, directly reducing depth of US–Canada industrial integration." />
